[I] Reparent a running program to a new terminal

[T] reptyr is a utility for taking an existing running program and attaching
[T] it to a new terminal, for example to move a long-running process started
[T] over ssh into a screen or tmux session.

[U] https://github.com/nelhage/reptyr

[A] nelhage
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS
